  - m_Id: 6720211339173888
    m_Localized: Who am I?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6720839771742208
    m_Localized: "You are Declan Kelly, a twenty-something living in rural Ireland
      in 2008, right after the Celtic Tiger collapsed and took every decent job with
      it.\n\nThere\u2019s no solid work around you, Dublin is too expensive, and
      your only real chance is getting to Australia to earn proper money on the mines
      or building sites.\n\nBut you need at least \u20AC5,000 before your working
      visa window closes, so you have put together a rough crew of local currach
      racers to win Sunday races. \n\nYou plan to take a cut from the betting money
      and scrape together enough cash to escape."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
